OL,3,ASurreal moment Tarantino and Kylie
OL,4,AMinogue came to my hometown to star in
OL,5,Amy new film
OL,6,
OL,7,FSharing a pint with Reservoir Dogs and
OL,8,FPulp Fiction director Quentin Tarantino
OL,9,Fin his local pub was a surreal
OL,10,Fexperience for a Welsh filmmaker.
OL,12,FBut this was just the tip of the
OL,13,Ficeberg for Jamie Adams, who also
OL,14,Fmanaged to get singing icon Kylie
OL,15,FMinogue and rapper RZA from the Wu-Tang
OL,16,FClan to Porthcawl for his new movie.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
