OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASurreal moment Tarantino and Kylie
OL,4,AMinogue came to my hometown to star in
OL,5,Amy new film
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe arrival of the stars in the seaside
OL,8,Ftown earlier this year to work on
OL,9,FTangled Up in Blue caused a buzz, and
OL,10,FAdams admitted it felt like "an out of
OL,11,Fbody experience" bringing his heroes to
OL,12,Fhis hometown.
OL,14,FIt is not the first time he has brought
OL,15,Fbig names to south Wales, having worked
OL,16,Fwith Dirty Dancing star Jennifer Grey
OL,17,Fon 2019 film Bittersweet Symphony.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
